    dct:description "The comparison figure plots sigma(k) at the nominal ratio 31.18 against the equal-diffusion curve, and k_c is marked. The ratio was raised from a trial value 12.42 (discriminant negative, pattern decayed) to 31.18 (pattern grows), which is one real expressivity check. Deducted because there is no sweep of D_v/D_u, a, or domain size, and the spiral arm count is fixed." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
